# Browser key for the Google Maps JavaScript API, used by the KSAS map screen
# (/#/ksas). Create one at https://console.cloud.google.com/google/maps-apis
# with the "Maps JavaScript API" enabled, and restrict it to your dev/device
# origins. Copy this file to `.env.local` and fill in the value.
VITE_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=
